  <name>RequestHub</name>
  <summary>Lightning-fast native HTTP client</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      RequestHub is a high-performance HTTP client written entirely in C.
      It provides a lightweight, native alternative to Electron-based API
      clients, with connection pooling,
      HTTP/2 multiplexing, and request history persistence.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Keep-alive connections for fast consecutive requests</li>
      <li>HTTP/2 support with multiplexing</li>
      <li>SSL/TLS verification enabled by default</li>
      <li>GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, PATCH, HEAD, OPTIONS methods</li>
      <li>Custom request headers and query parameters</li>
      <li>Local-first request history with one-click replay</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
